        "original_id": "3d840abb-a8f0-507b-9877-1fe57ea1fe39",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game, Yu-Gi-Oh! Official Card Game\n- Companies: Konami\n- People: Kazuki Takahashi\n- Concepts: Duel Monsters, game design\n- Topics: collectible card games, game creation\n\nFacts:\n- The Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game, known in Asia as the Yu-Gi-Oh! Official Card Game, is a Japanese collectible card game developed and published by Konami.\n- Duel Monsters is a fictional game created by manga artist Kazuki Takahashi.\n- Duel Monsters serves as the main plot device through most of Kazuki Takahashi's Yu-Gi-Oh! manga franchise.\n- The Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game is based on the fictional game Duel Monsters.\n- Game design is the art of applying design and aesthetics to create games for entertainment, education, exercise, or experimentation.",
